WEBVTT

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.766
Why? Because of screen-out.

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:33.106
AC: Even though I really
want to see my friends,

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:34.536
if I've been on Zoom all day,

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:37.656
I don't really want to spend
another couple hours on Zoom

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:41.146
just because, socially,
I'm tired of interacting,

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:43.123
but I'm a bit of an introvert, I suppose,

00:19:43.147 --> 00:19:45.213
so my energy is just depleted, usually,

00:19:45.237 --> 00:19:46.776
by the end of the day so.

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:49.078
AG: Introverts are more
sensitive to stimulation

00:19:49.102 --> 00:19:50.284
than extroverts,

00:19:50.308 --> 00:19:52.203
not just bright lights and loud noises,

00:19:52.227 --> 00:19:54.326
but also eye contact,

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:57.576
and video calls seem to be
magnifying that overload.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:59.986
AC: And you're staring
at somebody's eyes for,